      "id": "n0015",
      "kind": "INSTR_ACTION",
      "operation": "file.write",
      "resource": "unknown",
      "summary": "  - **跨多天的全天事件**拆成 N 条单日全天，每条仍是同一天 `00:00:00 ~ 23:59:59`，逐条调用 create 分别创建。",
      "provenance": {
        "file": "references/wecomcli-calendar-create.md",
        "line_start": 132,
        "line_end": 132
      },
      "candidate_status": "task_ambiguous",
      "authorization_source": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n0016",
      "kind": "INSTR_ACTION",
      "operation": "file.write",
      "resource": "unknown",
      "summary": "> 1. **先查询、后推荐、后创建**：要预订会议室时，`meeting_room_id` 必须来自 `rooms search` 返回的真实值，禁止跳过会议室查询直接 create，禁止凭记忆 / 上下文 / 猜测编造 `meeting_room_id`——没有先查到真实 ID 就不允许带 `meeting_room_id` 创建。同样地，在成功调用 `rooms search` 之前，禁止凭记忆 / 上下文 / 想象向用户罗列或推荐任何具体会议室（含用文字给出的候选、正文里的房间名 / 号 / 楼层 / 容量）——要让用户选会议室，必须先查到真实候选再组装选项。",
      "provenance": {
        "file": "references/wecomcli-calendar-create.md",
        "line_start": 150,
        "line_end": 150
      },
      "candidate_status": "task_ambiguous",
      "authorization_source": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n0017",
      "kind": "INSTR_ACTION",
      "operation": "file.write",
      "resource": "unknown",
      "summary": "> 4. **优先先订房、后建程**：用户在创建时就提到会议室的，应先把会议室敲定（拿到用户确认的 `meeting_room_id`）再进入步骤 4 创建日程，本步骤（3.5）是步骤 4 的前置阻塞项，避免创建后会议室被抢占。若会议室查询 / 选择尚未完成（如等待用户在候选中选择、等待用户确认换楼或换时间），必须停在本步骤等待，不得提前调用 create。若创建时漏订或事后要换会议室，可走 [calendar-update](wecomcli-calendar-update.md) 传入新 `meeting_room_id` 改订（须先经 `rooms search` 确认 `status=bookable`），不必取消重建。",
      "provenance": {
        "file": "references/wecomcli-calendar-create.md",
        "line_start": 153,
        "line_end": 153
      },
      "candidate_status": "task_ambiguous",
      "authorization_source": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n0018",
      "kind": "INSTR_ACTION",
      "operation": "file.write",
      "resource": "unknown",
      "summary": "4. 选定后将用户确认的 `meeting_room_id` 带入步骤 4 的 create，**只传 `meeting_room_id` 即可**（无需再把会议室名重复填进 `location`）。",
      "provenance": {
        "file": "references/wecomcli-calendar-create.md",
        "line_start": 165,
        "line_end": 165
      },
      "candidate_status": "task_ambiguous",
      "authorization_source": false
